                        "entry_id": "b7bd411b-bc98-321b-8ac0-11263da72420",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A part of the brain located rostral to the pons and caudal to the thalamus and the basal ganglia, composed of the tectum (dorsal portion) and the tegmentum (ventral portion)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f21b893-799e-4f45-adad-a41ae960e2ab",
                                "sense_id": "bf3927df-ce99-3804-8fc5-4880376b782c",
                                "text": "When the instinctive and subconscious world of the snake is confronted in initiation, the vital force of the snake rises and floods the second brain, the midbrain, the limbic ring."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
